# Required Songs (For people to want to make a soundtrack)
## Every track must be loopable (Besides the boss finish riff of course)
## For ideas of what i'd like the music to sound like, listen to the soundtracks of Donut County, Balatro, and MINDWAVE
- Main Menu
- Generic (Clean) - Standard melody, no extra tracks
- Generic (Combat) - More active, more tracks
- Generic (Boss) - Most active, slightly more than the combat theme, no need to go overboard
- Generic (Paused) - Chill version of the main melody
- Boss finish riff (Works the same as TBOIs Boss riff) (Not implemented yet) (Would be cool if the riff was a shortened version of the main melody)
- Sandbox (Not implemented yet)
- The Tutorialist (Final Boss) (Not implemented yet)
- Death Screen (Not implemented yet)

# Needed SFX
- Lightning strike (For Lightning Rod power item)
- Electicity (For electric stuff)
- Fire poof (For Wisp power item)
- Coin flick (For Coin and Lucky Penny power item)
- Egg cracking (For Egg power item)
- Throw (Like the minecraft throw sound) (For power items that throw things)
- Charge sound (Similar to TBOIs active item charge sound) (For power items)
- Player death sound
- Notification sound